      "author": "stagas",
      "published": "2026-08-16T17:49:46Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Cloudflare automatically injects client-side JavaScript analytics snippets into proxied HTML responses by default upon nameserver migration.",
        "Automatic script injection alters origin responses, potentially breaking JS-free architectures, integrity checks, or strict Content Security Policies (CSP).",
        "Disabling the tracking snippet requires navigating to the Cloudflare Analytics dashboard and explicitly opting out per domain."
